# Graphics trim, batch 02b: video editing, capture, disc burning and optical
# media. The video applications are not part of this product.
#
# Krita depends on libmlt7 and libmlt++7 for its animation timeline, so the
# MLT libraries and libmlt-data stay. Only the kdenlive front end and the
# melt command are removed here; do not add the libraries to this list.
#
# ffmpeg stays as well. Krita, Pencil2D and ImageMagick depend on it, so it is
# a graphics runtime in this image even though it is a video tool by name.

kdenlive
kdenlive-data
melt
mplayer
ffmpegthumbs
subtitleeditor
libsubtitleeditor0
devede
dvd+rw-tools
dvdauthor
vcdimager
wodim
genisoimage
cdrdao
k3b
k3b-data
libk3b8t64
libk3b-extracodecs
obs-studio
obs-plugins
libobs0t64
obs-pipewire-audio-capture
vlc
vlc-plugin-pipewire
xjadeo
harvid
qprompt
